    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d607">

                <pb facs="0619" n="585" sameAs="frus:frus1897/pg585"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Terrell to Mr.
                            Sherman.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Constantinople</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1897-04-24"><hi rendition="#italic">April 24,
                        1897</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>I have protested against the sudden expulsion of peaceful Greeks who are in the
                    employ and who protect American interests here.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Terrell.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
